no! Example 9: delayed assignment. A lone No line followed by a
two-spaces-and-U line assigns the current value to the two-space
binding when the current phase ends. !no
!"first"!, NO  u
no	u, no  u, No, No, No, No, No, NOOOOOO UUUUUUUU
!"second"!
No
  U
no	u, no  u, No, No, No, No, No, NOOOOOO UUUUUUUU
 no	u, no  u, No, No, No, No, No, NOOOOOO UUUUUUUU
